          "docs": "Permanently delete a mitigation.\n\n<strong>Limitations</strong>:\n* You cannot delete the mitigation if the objective it belongs to has been checked out using\n<a href=\"https://help.highbond.com/helpdocs/highbond/en-us/Default.htm#cshid=pm-offline-client\" target=\"_blank\">Offline Projects</a> or the\n<a href=\"https://help.highbond.com/helpdocs/highbond/en-us/Default.htm#cshid=pm-mobile\" target=\"_blank\">HighBond iPad app</a>.\n\n> **Caution —**\nDeleting a mitigation is permanent. Once deleted, you canno"
        }
